132 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 97 0 R
/T (I like to think about these as the natural stages of evolution of any creative idea \(regardless of the field\). A creative idea starts as humor \(a joke, a parody, a riddle, a mistake\), which then evolves into science \(understanding the reasons, the theory behind the initial idea\), and eventually becoming art \(the process isn't rational anymore, it's purely expressive/poetic\). )
/E (I like to think about these as the natural stages of evolution of any creative idea \(regardless of the field\). A creative idea starts as humor \(a joke, a parody, a riddle, a mistake\), which then evolves into science \(understanding the reasons, the theory behind the initial idea\), and eventually becoming art \(the process isn't rational anymore, it's purely expressive/poetic\). )
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
